    "Script has not been evaluated yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脚本尚未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripts run as your macOS user with /bin/zsh. Exit code 0 matches; other exit codes do not. Each run stops after 2 seconds. Scripts can access files and network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脚本将以当前 macOS 用户身份通过 /bin/zsh 运行。退出码为 0 表示匹配，其他退出码表示不匹配。每次运行最长 2 秒。脚本可以访问文件和网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar item must be visible when you capture its reference. macOS may show a screen-capture privacy indicator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "捕获参考图像时，菜单栏项目必须处于可见状态。macOS 可能会显示屏幕录制隐私指示器。"
          }
